From eda903a0f0336c62f9f54f4eb6df7b1a875bdbd0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CarlosDLMC <delamorenacoco.carlos@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:49:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: drag anything drawn with the pointer tool

Arrows, lines, rectangles, ellipses, markers, brush strokes, highlights
and blurs can be picked up and dragged with the pointer tool, as texts
already could; the text tool still picks up texts only. Each drawing
answers a hit test (on the stroke, or inside when filled) and is
outlined while held. A blur re-blurs what is under it after any move.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
